---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="limits" class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="limits-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Limitations</p>
      <h2 id="limits-title">What to know before you install</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Krova is early software, version 0.1. These are the limits you can run into today, stated up front.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul class="list">
      <li class="card">
        <Icon name="warn" />
        <div>
          <h3>Administrator apps are skipped on Windows</h3>
          <p>
            Windows of apps that run elevated (as administrator) are skipped, so Krova will not snap them. Minimized and
            full-screen windows are skipped too.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <Icon name="lock" />
        <div>
          <h3>macOS needs Accessibility permission</h3>
          <p>
            To move other apps’ windows, macOS requires you to grant Krova access under System Settings, Privacy &amp;
            Security, Accessibility. Without it, snapping cannot work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <Icon name="monitors" />
        <div>
          <h3>Windows and macOS only</h3>
          <p>Linux is not supported. Krova targets Windows 10/11 and macOS 13 (Ventura) or later.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <Icon name="clock" />
        <div>
          <h3>No keyboard-shortcut layouts yet</h3>
          <p>
            Layouts you can trigger with a keyboard shortcut are planned for v0.2. In v0.1 you snap by dragging. Window
            stacks and tabs, and hover-to-activate, are not part of v0.1 either.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .list {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-m);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 26rem), 1fr));
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    align-items: flex-start;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .card :global(.icon) {
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-2);
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xs);
  }

  p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
